  "masked_text": "[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00295:c3c8ad782982]]\n\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00296:921a3bfde588]]\n题目研究的是[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00297:6c88e2170afe]]。已知[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00298:53f600770680]]，同时受到[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00299:47896803991a]]限制。问题一要求[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00300:470f17dd9a8a]]；问题二在[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00301:87eebaf36789]]基础上要求[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00302:47aff7597f86]]；问题三进一步比较或决定[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00303:47aff7597f86]]。本文将[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00304:d7df398d61e6]]分别记账。\n\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00305:101ce9a16d9d]]不在重述中提前宣布[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00306:5392fb06a8a2]]，不改变题面中的对象范围、时间窗、单位和[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00307:48a5d977c647]]等语气，不把附件中没有的字段补成已知量。\n\n",
